WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.990
Pros don't buy just anywhere. They buy right here.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.560
An Order Block is the last opposite candle before a strong impulse.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:14.760
Step one: find the last red candle before the rally.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:19.960
Step two: mark the zone and wait for the pullback.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:24.160
Step three: enter inside the zone, stop below it.

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:29.800
Common mistake: marking every red candle. No impulse, no Order Block.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.400
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:38.150
I show setups like this live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
